1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,040
Make a fist.

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:01,940
Can you raise

3
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,940
ONLY your middle finger?

4
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:05,690
Ring finger came too?

5
00:00:05,690 --> 00:00:06,708
They're...

6
00:00:06,708 --> 00:00:07,933
handcuffed.

7
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,114
Now try just your

8
00:00:09,114 --> 00:00:10,340
RING finger.

9
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,190
Stuck?

10
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:11,715
It's cuffed

11
00:00:11,715 --> 00:00:13,533
on BOTH sides.

12
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:15,610
A perfect one takes

13
00:00:15,610 --> 00:00:16,967
PRACTICE.

14
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,367
Composer Robert Schumann

15
00:00:18,405 --> 00:00:19,821
trained his middle finger

16
00:00:19,821 --> 00:00:20,991
with a gadget...

17
00:00:20,991 --> 00:00:22,567
and it went stiff.

18
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:23,820
Piano career:

19
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:24,700
over.

20
00:00:24,732 --> 00:00:26,430
The gadget's fault?

21
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:28,800
Historians still argue.

22
00:00:28,830 --> 00:00:30,630
Now try the OTHER hand...

23
00:00:30,630 --> 00:00:31,475
just don't point it

24
00:00:31,475 --> 00:00:32,700
at anyone.

